From: kgw-ds <kgw-ds@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:50:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bananads): fast-forward sound at normal speed
 (kms.ff_music)

While a DS game is fast-forwarded in BananaDS, its music and sound
effects keep their own tempo and pitch instead of fading out.

- buildroot/patches/bananads/0500: BananaDS's kms.ff_music and its
  melonDS patch 0500 (a sound clock for the ARM7's timers and the SPU,
  exact under FastTimers and FastMix), with host tests and CI checks.
- Settings > Nintendo DS > BananaDS > Fast-forward sound: Normal speed
  (kms.ff_music = on, the default) or Silent (off, as before).
